('wyn-0050-inni-udhtu-bi-rabbi-wa-rabbikum-min-kulli-mutaka', 'Inni ''udhtu bi rabbi wa rabbikum min kulli mutakabbirin la yu''minu bi yawmil hisab', null, 'وَقَالَ مُوسَىٰٓ إِنِّى عُذْتُ بِرَبِّى وَرَبِّكُم مِّن كُلِّ مُتَكَبِّرٍ لَّا يُؤْمِنُ بِيَوْمِ ٱلْحِسَابِ', null, null, null, 'But Moses said, "Indeed, I have sought refuge in my Lord and your Lord from every arrogant one who does not believe in the Day of Account."', 'موسیٰؑ نے کہا "میں نے تو ہر اُس متکبر کے مقابلے میں جو یَوم الحساب پر ایمان نہیں رکھتا اپنے ر ب اور تمہارے رب کی پناہ لے لی ہے"', null, null, 'quran', null, 'Qur''an 40:27', null, null, '[{"surah":40,"ayah_from":27,"ayah_to":27}]'::jsonb, null, 'draft', 'needs_review', 'Wa Iyyaka Nasta''in WYN-0050 (Protection from Enemies); VERIFIED reference check in the research inventory. Arabic/English are the referenced Qur''an passage from IqraSpace''s dataset / Saheeh International; confirm this is the full wording the dua uses and add a transliteration. Printed grade: Not applicable / not printed. translation_ur = Urdu translation of the Qur''an (Al Quran Cloud ur.maududi, Tafheem ul Quran), unmodified.', 'wyn_public_pdf', array['WYN-0050']::text[], 5033),
