('wyn-0065-rabbi-audhubika-min-hamazatish-shayatin-wa-audhu', 'Rabbi a''udhubika min hamazatish shayatin wa a''udhubika Rabbi an yahdurun', null, 'وَقُل رَّبِّ أَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنْ هَمَزَٰتِ ٱلشَّيَـٰطِينِ وَأَعُوذُ بِكَ رَبِّ أَن يَحْضُرُونِ', null, null, null, 'And say, "My Lord, I seek refuge in You from the incitements of the devils, And I seek refuge in You, my Lord, lest they be present with me."', 'اور دعا کرو کہ "پروردگار، میں شیاطین کی اکساہٹوں سے تیری پناہ مانگتا ہوں بلکہ اے میرے رب، میں تو اس سے بھی تیری پناہ مانگتا ہوں کہ وہ میرے پاس آئیں"', null, 3, 'quran', null, 'Qur''an 23:97-98', null, null, '[{"surah":23,"ayah_from":97,"ayah_to":98}]'::jsonb, null, 'draft', 'needs_review', 'Wa Iyyaka Nasta''in WYN-0065 (Waswasa / Evil Whisperings); VERIFIED reference check in the research inventory; printed repetition: "3". Arabic/English are the referenced Qur''an passage from IqraSpace''s dataset / Saheeh International; confirm this is the full wording the dua uses and add a transliteration. Printed grade: Not applicable / not printed. translation_ur = Urdu translation of the Qur''an (Al Quran Cloud ur.maududi, Tafheem ul Quran), unmodified.', 'wyn_public_pdf', array['WYN-0065']::text[], 5038),
