('wyn-0093-anni-massaniyad-durru-wa-anta-arhamur-rahimin', 'Anni massaniyad durru wa anta arhamur rahimin', null, '۞ وَأَيُّوبَ إِذْ نَادَىٰ رَبَّهُۥٓ أَنِّى مَسَّنِىَ ٱلضُّرُّ وَأَنتَ أَرْحَمُ ٱلرَّٰحِمِينَ', null, null, null, 'And [mention] Job, when he called to his Lord, "Indeed, adversity has touched me, and you are the Most Merciful of the merciful."', 'اور یہی (ہوش مندی اور حکم و علم کی نعمت) ہم نے ایّوبؑ کو دی تھی یاد کرو، جبکہ اس نے اپنے رب کو پکارا کہ "مجھے بیماری لگ گئی ہے اور تو ارحم الراحمین ہے"', null, null, 'quran', null, 'Qur''an 21:83', null, null, '[{"surah":21,"ayah_from":83,"ayah_to":83}]'::jsonb, null, 'draft', 'needs_review', 'Wa Iyyaka Nasta''in WYN-0093 (Healing); VERIFIED reference check in the research inventory. Arabic/English are the referenced Qur''an passage from IqraSpace''s dataset / Saheeh International; confirm this is the full wording the dua uses and add a transliteration. Printed grade: Not applicable / not printed. translation_ur = Urdu translation of the Qur''an (Al Quran Cloud ur.maududi, Tafheem ul Quran), unmodified.', 'wyn_public_pdf', array['WYN-0093']::text[], 5046),
